{
  "$description": "Every place the v12 lane departs from Carbon, as data. `axis` is color, shape, space, type, elevation, api or other. `status` is explore (an @carbon-explore mark) or proposal (an @carbon-proposal mark); an entry adopted upstream or dropped leaves the list. `appliesTo` says where the marks go: `in` is a component folder, or a path from the repository root; `props` puts a mark on every declaration of those props that the folder's components export; `uses` puts one mark above the first code line that holds any of those strings, when the place has none. `yarn v12:departures --write` places them; `yarn v12:check` warns on an entry without its marks and on a mark without an entry.",
  "departures": [
    {
      "id": "page-base",
      "axis": "color",
      "status": "explore",
      "what": "The page's background is a half step off white and black (#fafafa light, #0b0b0b dark), so the surfaces on it can step darker in light themes and lighter in dark ones.",
      "replaces": "`$background` (#ffffff light, #161616 dark), with the field and its hairline solved for that page.",
      "appliesTo": [
        {
          "in": "packages/v12-styles/src/styles/_surface.scss",
          "uses": ["--cds-background: #fafafa"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "surface-quiet",
